## User

The elements at even positions (0, 2, 4, ...) of a list.

## Type

type
```agda
everyOther : List ℕ → List ℕ
```

## Term

```agda
everyOther [] = []
everyOther (x ∷ xs) = x ∷ everyOther xs
```

## agda

```agda
everyOther-even : ∀ xs → even (length xs)
```

## agda

```agda
everyOther-even [] = even-zero
everyOther-even (x ∷ xs) = even-suc (everyOther-even xs)
```

## agda

```agda
everyOther-even' : ∀ xs → even (length xs)
```

## agda

```agda
everyOther-even' xs = even-suc (everyOther-even xs)
```

